window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/security-v27-016-cb95b3bf2da41b77.json"]={sha256:"cb95b3bf2da41b77a827d7f6ae2e5e13372a7f18f522d90db2dfda402ea108d4",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v27-case-0a869a40fea35016","url":"https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9180.html","title":"RFC 9180: Hybrid Public Key Encryption","titleEn":"RFC 9180: Hybrid Public Key Encryption","publisher":"IRTF","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"security-v27-016","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"security-v27-016","related":[{"id":"security-v27-017","referenceUrls":["https://theupdateframework.github.io/specification/v1.0.36/"],"title":"TUF：根中繼資料輪替的雙門檻驗證","titleEn":"TUF: dual-threshold verification during root rotation","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：4.8%與19.2%可重算，跨租戶上下文負例無法驗證；未把base模式誤稱已認證寄件者。 交付hpke-context.json、各欄位UTF-8位元組與負擔表；只保存測試公鑰與無敏感明文。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Reproduce 4.8 and 19.2 percent and reject cross-tenant context mismatches. Do not claim that base-mode encryption alone authenticates the sender. Deliver hpke-context.json, exact UTF-8 context bytes and the overhead table. Preserve only test public keys and nonsensitive plaintext with enough suite metadata to reproduce the experiment.","difference":"建立版本N與N+1根描述，分開列舊keyid集合、新集合及各門檻；對版本跳號、未知keyid及重複簽章各建負例。","differenceEn":"Build root descriptors for versions N and N+1 with separate old and new key sets and thresholds. Add skipped-version, unknown-key and repeated-signature counterexamples before evaluating the proposed transition.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["info在設定時綁定應用上下文，AAD在訊息認證中綁定額外資料；本課的封裝長度與標籤長度為指定套件假設，不能推廣為所有HPKE組合。 單筆訊息明文1000位元組，封裝公鑰32位元組，AEAD標籤16位元組；暫不計序列化、傳輸標頭及重用上下文。 額外負擔(32+16)/1000×100=4.8%；明文縮至250位元組而其他固定時，負擔為19.2%。","同一新根須依舊根與新根要求各自驗證；一個KEYID只能計一次。以每側有效唯一簽章數除以門檻，再取較小值，作為本課的瓶頸指標。 舊根門檻2且有效唯一簽章2，新根門檻3且有效唯一簽章2；另外附一份重複的新根簽章，不能增加計數。 瓶頸min(2/2,2/3)=2/3；補第三個有效新keyid後min(2/2,3/3)=1，兩側才都足額。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Bind application context during setup through info and message metadata through AAD. Encapsulation and authentication-tag lengths below are assumptions for the selected suite, not universal sizes for every HPKE combination or mode. For one independently encapsulated message use 1000 plaintext bytes, 32 encapsulation bytes and a 16-byte AEAD tag. Exclude serialization, transport headers and reused-context amortization so the scope of the overhead calculation remains explicit. Relative overhead is (32+16)/1000×100=4.8 percent. Reducing plaintext to 250 bytes while holding encapsulation and tag sizes fixed gives 19.2 percent; this compares added bytes with plaintext, not with total wire size.","Verify the proposed root under both old and new requirements, counting each KEYID once. Divide valid unique signatures by each threshold and take the smaller ratio as a local bottleneck indicator; acceptance still requires both sides to meet their thresholds. The old threshold is two with two valid unique signatures; the new threshold is three with two. Include a duplicate new-root signature object, which must not increase the count or disguise the missing independent signer. The bottleneck is min(2/2, 2/3)=2/3. Adding a third valid new KEYID makes min(2/2, 3/3)=1. A ratio below one identifies an unmet quorum, not a percentage probability of compromise.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"security-v27-026","referenceUrls":["https://istio.io/latest/docs/tasks/security/authorization/authz-tcp/"],"title":"Istio：HTTP條件在TCP DENY規則中的缺屬性效應","titleEn":"Istio: missing HTTP attributes in TCP DENY policies","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：4.8%與19.2%可重算，跨租戶上下文負例無法驗證；未把base模式誤稱已認證寄件者。 交付hpke-context.json、各欄位UTF-8位元組與負擔表；只保存測試公鑰與無敏感明文。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Reproduce 4.8 and 19.2 percent and reject cross-tenant context mismatches. Do not claim that base-mode encryption alone authenticates the sender. Deliver hpke-context.json, exact UTF-8 context bytes and the overhead table. Preserve only test public keys and nonsensitive plaintext with enough suite metadata to reproduce the experiment.","difference":"建立HTTP與TCP連線描述，記錄目的埠、method是否存在及政策selector；使用缺值而非空字串表示TCP沒有HTTP方法。","differenceEn":"Build HTTP and TCP connection descriptors with destination port, method presence and policy selector. Represent an unavailable HTTP method as absent, not as an empty string that accidentally changes the policy matching semantics.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["info在設定時綁定應用上下文，AAD在訊息認證中綁定額外資料；本課的封裝長度與標籤長度為指定套件假設，不能推廣為所有HPKE組合。 單筆訊息明文1000位元組，封裝公鑰32位元組，AEAD標籤16位元組；暫不計序列化、傳輸標頭及重用上下文。 額外負擔(32+16)/1000×100=4.8%；明文縮至250位元組而其他固定時，負擔為19.2%。","本課依文件檢查DENY的缺屬性效應，將方法限制明確限於HTTP目的埠；計算原本誤受影響的TCP集合大小，不把ALLOW規則缺值語意混用。 20筆連線中8筆為TCP且目的埠非8080；未限埠的HTTP DENY在模型中影響這8筆，其他12筆另依HTTP條件判定。 非預期影響率8/20×100=40%；加上8080埠範圍後該8筆中誤受影響數為0，比例0%。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Bind application context during setup through info and message metadata through AAD. Encapsulation and authentication-tag lengths below are assumptions for the selected suite, not universal sizes for every HPKE combination or mode. For one independently encapsulated message use 1000 plaintext bytes, 32 encapsulation bytes and a 16-byte AEAD tag. Exclude serialization, transport headers and reused-context amortization so the scope of the overhead calculation remains explicit. Relative overhead is (32+16)/1000×100=4.8 percent. Reducing plaintext to 250 bytes while holding encapsulation and tag sizes fixed gives 19.2 percent; this compares added bytes with plaintext, not with total wire size.","Follow documented DENY behavior for missing attributes and scope the method restriction to its intended HTTP port. Count the unintentionally affected TCP set without importing different missing-value assumptions from an ALLOW policy. Of 20 connections, eight are TCP on ports other than 8080. The unscoped HTTP-based DENY affects those eight in the model, while twelve HTTP rows are evaluated against their own method conditions. Unintended impact is 8/20×100=40 percent. Adding the intended 8080 scope leaves zero of those eight TCP rows unintentionally affected, or zero percent of the fixed population.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v27-case-03c052c71ca82c39","url":"https://theupdateframework.github.io/specification/v1.0.36/","title":"The Update Framework specification 1.0.36","titleEn":"The Update Framework specification 1.0.36","publisher":"The Update Framework","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v27-case-7dc148ad92eb2f3f","url":"https://istio.io/latest/docs/tasks/security/authorization/authz-tcp/","title":"Istio authorization policies for TCP traffic","titleEn":"Istio authorization policies for TCP traffic","publisher":"Istio","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
